/DV (THE PROBLEM\012What problem are you addressing\077 Who experiences it\054 and why is it important to solve\077\012\012YOUR SOLUTION\012How does your project address this problem\077 Describe the core idea and what makes it unique\054 useful or innovative\056\012\012THE WORKING PROTOTYPE\012What can users do with your project today\077 Walk us through the main features and distinguish what is already implemented and working\056\012\012BEHIND THE BUILD\012Explain how the key components work together and the technical decisions that shaped the implementation\056 Identify existing tools\054 libraries\054 services or codebases you built upon\054 and what your team created during the hackathon\056\012\012CHALLENGES AND DISCOVERIES\012What challenges did you encounter\077 What approaches did you try\054 and what did you learn\077\012\012RESULTS AND NEXT STEPS\012What did you achieve\054 and how did you validate or test it\077 Share the outcome you are most proud of\054 current limitations and what you would improve next\056)
/F 4
