/P 16 0 R
/Rect [ 42 176 553.2756 686 ]
/Subtype /Widget
/T (project\137overview)
/Type /Annot
/V (THE PROBLEM\012Small business owners decide by looking at the bank balance\054 and the balance lies\056 It doesn\047t show money owed back to employees\054 taxes\012already due\054 or clients who always pay late\056 In our demo company the bank shows 38\054400 PLN\054 but two weeks later the company is 7\054870\012PLN short\056 Owners like this can\047t afford a CFO and find out about the gap when a payment bounces\056\012\012YOUR SOLUTION\012Ordo connects to the mailbox\054 the bank accounts and the exchange rates\054 and keeps the books itself\056 It forecasts cash 45 days ahead\056 When\012a gap is coming\054 it explains why and prepares the fix\072 a payment reminder\054 a deferred payment or a credit line\056 A second agent\054 FX Shield\054\012proposes a currency hedge only when an exchange\055rate move could really hurt a deal\056\012What makes it different\072 the owner decides every action\054 and every action runs in a simulated bank\056 All numbers come from code\073 the AI\012reads and explains but never invents a figure\056 The open\055weights model runs on our own cluster\054 so no data goes to an outside AI service\056\012\012THE WORKING PROTOTYPE\012All of this works on the cluster today\072\012\055 Automatic intake\072 data arrives on its own from the mailbox\054 the bank and the NBP rates\056\012\055 Document reading\072 a receipt photo or PDF is read into fields\073 unsure fields are flagged\056\012\055 Matching\072 duplicates merge\054 each document is matched to its bank line\054 and Ordo works out who paid\056\012\055 One\055tap approval\072 an employee\047s private\055card receipt becomes \042Pay Jan back\042\073 one tap pays it in the test bank\056\012\055 Forecast\072 a cash chart with the coming gap\054 its causes\054 a stress case and options to close it\056\012\055 FX Shield\072 \042hedge\042 or \042no need\042 per foreign\055currency invoice\054 from 756 days of real NBP rates\056\012\055 Ask Ordo\072 a chat over the company\047s data\073 account and card numbers are masked\054 off\055topic questions refused\056\012\055 Web app\072 Overview\054 Finances\054 To\055do\054 an activity log with undo\054 Settings\073 a software studio and a pizzeria\056\012\012BEHIND THE BUILD\012Connectors write raw data\056 A PostgreSQL event queue passes it to the extractor\054 the matching pipeline\054 the finance engine and the agents\056\012The API records every decision and runs the approved action in the test bank in the same request\056\012Key decisions\072 a forecast without ML \050recurring payments\054 averages\054 known invoices\051\054 fully explainable and within about 1\0562\045 on the pizzeria\012data seven weeks ahead\073 one model on one GPU \050gpt\055oss\05520b reads\054 sorts and calls the agents\047 tools\073 OCR runs on CPU\051\073 our own test\012bank\054 because Polish banks need a licence for sandbox access\056\012Built on OpenShift AI\054 vLLM\054 gpt\055oss\05520b\054 docling\055serve\054 OGX\054 NeMo Guardrails\054 MLflow\054 FastAPI and React\056 The team wrote all application\012code\054 the demo data and the cluster setup during the hackathon\054 working with Claude Code as a coding assistant\056\012\012CHALLENGES AND DISCOVERIES\012\055 One GPU holds one model\072 we dropped a vision model and do OCR on CPU\054 at about 11 seconds per document\056\012\055 VAT on photos is hard to read \05026 of 59 right\051\054 so each field shows how sure Ordo is and the owner confirms\056\012\055 Keeping the AI honest\072 an answer with a number no calculation produced is rejected and replaced by a template\056\012\055 Running the full flow on the cluster found two bad test records that broke the forecast\073 demo numbers are now pinned in CI\056\012\012RESULTS AND NEXT STEPS\012The full flow runs on the cluster\072 data in\054 books\054 forecast\054 an agent\047s proposal\054 approval and simulated execution\056\012Tested with 788 backend and 76 frontend tests in CI\073 an MLflow evaluation on 59 documents \050total amount right on 59\054 date and seller tax\012number on 58\054 VAT on 26\051\073 a 40\055second cluster smoke test\056\012Proudest of\072 an owner who isn\047t a finance person sees a cash gap two weeks early and closes it with one tap\056\012Limitations\072 VAT reading on photos\073 every action is simulated\073 no fallback model\056\012Next\072 better VAT reading\054 a real bank connection through a licensed partner such as Commerzbank\054 a KSeF API connector\056)
>>
endobj
